#1 Quick start

## Install

```bash
npm install
npm test
```

## Your first document

```text
#1 My first document

This is a paragraph.

- first item
- second item
```

## Parse and render

```typescript
import { parseDocument, renderHtml } from "structmark-language-core";

const document = parseDocument(source);
const html = renderHtml(document);
```

`parseDocument` only parses the source. It does not execute code or access the network or filesystem.

## Where to go next

Read the block and inline syntax pages, then edit a real source in the Playground and inspect its HTML and diagnostics.
